codex
The proof is CPU-bound but stable at about 1.2 GB, well inside the 8 GB limit. It is replaying eleven independent claims cumulatively; I’m preserving this broader 1–11 coverage, since weakening to only the five doctest examples would finish faster but provide materially less evidence.
